  "description": "EH3D-TOOL-MANAGER is a Rust library and command line for the tool crib of the suite: tools with their geometry and wear, JSON and CSV storage and starting feeds and speeds by material. Built with the gui feature it also has a window (egui) with the table of the tools, a form, filters, CSV import and export and a calculator that shows its formulas; the numbers of the calculation are read from tools.cfg. The CAM programs do not read the crib yet.",
